                                        "entry_id": "11978235-2756-3f61-b546-c588eea0087a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A former kingdom in the Red Sea region. An ancient kingdom in Arabia or possibly in Africa. Frequently equated with ancient Saba."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8b47b11-f103-4d90-878e-4c3f587b8014",
                                                "sense_id": "bc6915c3-9290-3ecb-9e89-e27b72698514",
                                                "text": "And when the queen of Sheba heard of the fame of Solomon concerning the name of the LORD, she came to prove him with hard questions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7dc6851a-f089-345f-be8a-185c3c64f3b7",
                                        "entry_id": "11978235-2756-3f61-b546-c588eea0087a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from Hebrew."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b4bba34-1fcc-44d2-9eaa-6f77edc98ddb",
                                                "sense_id": "7dc6851a-f089-345f-be8a-185c3c64f3b7",
                                                "text": "And there happened to be there a man of Belial, whose name was Sheba, the son of Bichri, a Benjamite: and he blew a trumpet, and said, We have no part in David, neither have we inheritance in the son of Jesse: every man to his tents, O Israel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
