                                                "sense_id": "0bd0b740-40f1-3acf-b240-e9f7352b7d61",
                                                "text": "'I was kinda sweet on her my own self. Sheba Otis, her name was then.' I was surprised. 'She married a Queen? Which one?' 'Can't say.' He sighed. 'Her name's Bathsheba, but she never liked that much.'"
